  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only multiprofile configurations (e.g., config_005: 0.650 accuracy) outperform multimodal baselines. This experiment tests scgpt encoder in RNA-only multiprofile setup (config_008) to isolate the impact of RNA encoder choice. It directly compares scgpt (potentially more expressive) against scvi_n200 (used in config_005), helping determine if encoder selection significantly affects performance. This addresses a key uncertainty while building on the promising RNA-only multiprofile direction."
